%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as Script
  participant P1 as Queue
  participant P2 as Host decide
  participant P3 as Guest decide
  participant P4 as Adapters
  participant P5 as Checks
  P0->>P1: exec X1
  P1->>P2: deliver X1
  P2->>P4: effect: reserve slot
  P2->>P4: effect: dispatch X1
  P4->>P1: guest event: X1 arrives
  P1->>P3: deliver X1 arrives
  P3->>P4: journal+run
  P0->>P4: fault: lose the acceptance reply
  Note over P0,P5: scripted outage: control plane unavailable
  P4->>P1: guest event: output, then exit 0
  P1->>P3: deliver exit 0
  P3->>P4: journal exit
  Note over P0,P5: scripted restart: rebuild from committed records
  Note over P2: X1 uncertain, slot kept
  P2->>P4: effect: inspect X1
  P4->>P1: completion: X1 finished
  P1->>P2: deliver done
  P2->>P5: state + effects
  Note over P5: one execution? honest cursor?
